    "level": "medium",
    "touches": ["rpc_api", "validation"],
    "why": "Incorrect prune lock handling or crashes during block file prune checks could allow blocks required for rescanning to be prematurely deleted or cause disk space usage to grow unexpectedly beyond user limits."
  }
